{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","body":"永遇乐·京口北固亭怀古[1]\n\n辛弃疾\n\n千古江山，英雄无觅，孙仲谋处。舞榭歌台，风流总被，雨打风吹去。斜阳草树，寻常巷陌，人道寄奴曾住[2]。想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎[3]。\n\n元嘉草草[4]，封狼居胥[5]，赢得仓皇北顾[6]。四十三年[7]，望中犹记，烽火扬州路[8]。可堪回首，佛狸祠[9]下，一片神鸦[10]社鼓[11]。凭谁问：廉颇老矣，尚能饭否[12]？","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-21T12:03:49Z","derivedAuthor":"辛弃疾","derivedFrom":"lesson-1706","excerpt":"永遇乐·京口北固亭怀古 [12] \n辛弃疾\n千古江山，英雄无觅，孙仲谋处。舞榭歌台，风流总被，雨打风吹去。斜阳草树，寻常巷陌，人道寄奴曾住 [13] 。想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎 [14] 。\n元嘉草草 [15] ，封狼居胥 [16] ，赢得仓皇北顾 [17] 。四十三年 [18] ，望中犹记，烽火扬州路 [19] 。可堪回首，佛狸祠 [20] 下，一片神鸦 [21] 社鼓 [22] 。凭谁问：廉颇老矣，尚能饭否 [23] ？","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1706","id":"lesson-1706-p2","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-21T12:03:49Z","id":"11138-2","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-12","text":"[12]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-13","text":"[13]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-14","text":"[14]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-15","text":"[15]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-16","text":"[1